    "detailed_description": "Have you ever had the opportunity to participate in a real offroad? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith a proper car, equipped with 4x4 and good tyres, no hill can't stop you. <br />\r\nBut it's not quite like that.... However,the jeep makes only 50% of the success. No one has yet overturned the professionalism. Your mission is to demonstrate how good a driver you are in offroad conditions having a time limit for each challenge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis racing game challenges you to combine both to conquer the steepest valleys and the highest hills. Show everyone that you have no fear! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features :<br />\r\n- 10 missions<br />\r\n- 4 off-road equipped jeeps<br />\r\n- Time limit for each challenge",
